Model: V3 Vector
Style: Board Ghosts2
Prompt:
A friendly cartoon ghost floating and facing forward toward the viewer,
with two short simple rounded arm stubs. Frightened, panicked
expression: very wide huge round eyes, eyebrows angled upward in the
middle in a worried, pleading look, mouth open wide in a big gasp.
Body flinching and trembling, with small shake lines around it. The
lower part of the ghost flares outward into a wide, open, ragged bottom
with several long separate flowing wisps and tails hanging down, like a
classic sheet ghost with a soft rounded top and a loose flowing shape.
Cute and endearing, meek and helpless.

